### Get all countries
GET  {{baseUrl}}/api/countries

### Get country by Id use Apikey or Admin role
GET  {{baseUrl}}/api/countries/35
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Create a new country
POST  {{baseUrl}}/api/countries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Ser6bian25",
  "description": "Not bad as mad",
  "mainImageURL": "23",
  "secondaryImageURL": "2223",
  "continent": "467"
}

### Update the country
PUT  {{baseUrl}}/api/countries/35222
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "id":325,
  "name": "Italyyyius",
  "description": "Not bad as mad2",
  "mainImageURL": "23",
  "secondaryImageURL": "2223",
  "continent": "Australia"
}

### Delete the country
DELETE  {{baseUrl}}/api/countries/29
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Bearer {{authToken}}